// Single trivial 1x1 BTile (G7-4).
//
// DEVIATION (G7-4 "referencing one PNG"): datagen.pl rejects PNG asset
// conversion for CPC platforms — `dispatch_png_asset_handling` dies with
// "CPC asset conversion not yet wired — see Phase A5" (tools/datagen.pl
// ~line 1509).  PNG->CPC is a later phase (A5), out of scope for the G7
// stub.  We therefore use an equally-trivial inline PIXELS bitmap, which
// flows through datagen identically on ZX and CPC and needs no asset
// pipeline.  Each pixel is two chars ("##"=set, ".."=clear), so an 8x8
// cell is 16 chars wide x 8 rows (matching e.g. games/minimal Live.gdata).
// ATTR is ZX-only and inert on CPC (two-layer colour model); kept for
// source/datagen symmetry.
BEGIN_BTILE
	NAME	Tile
	ROWS	1
	COLS	1

	PIXELS	################
	PIXELS	##............##
	PIXELS	##..########..##
	PIXELS	##..##....##..##
	PIXELS	##..##....##..##
	PIXELS	##..########..##
	PIXELS	##............##
	PIXELS	################

	ATTR	INK_WHITE | PAPER_BLACK
END_BTILE
